//!--------------------------// Welcome Screen \\--------------------------!\\ Welcome to Munchkin
Munchkin is an open-source device which contains functional hardware that allows us to audit different wireless networks, such as WiFi, BLE, and Zigbee. With this application, you can communicate and execute commands with your Munchkin device through different ways of connection.
Logo Electronic Cats
//Welcome Screen2 It’s time to begin!
Connect your Munchkin device either by Serial, Bluetooth or WiFi\n\n Feel free to check the list of compatible devices with this app.\n\n https://electroniccats.com/
